("Helena. Please. Open the door. I'm not going to hurt you.") Tj
1 0 0 1 50 525 Tm
(His Polish was perfect. Of course it was. He had always been good with languages. It was one of the things) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 505 Tm
(She stopped the thought. She would not go there. Not now. Not ever.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 485 Tm
(She stood with her back against the door, her chest heaving, Marysia pressed against her side, the girl's face buried in her coat. She could feel Marysia's tears through the wool.) Tj
