1 0 0 1 50 125 Tm
(He stopped. He didn't need to finish. They both knew what happened in Pruszkow. They both knew what happened to unclaimed children in the transit camps. Some of them were Germanizedsent to families in the Reich, their Polish names erased, their identities overwritten. Some of them disappeared entirely. The machinery of the occupation did not distinguish between children and adults when it came to the business of consumption.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 105 Tm
("Why?" Helena's voice was barely audible. "Why are you doing this?") Tj
1 0 0 1 50 85 Tm
(A long pause.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 65 Tm
("Because I'm a coward, Helena. I've been a coward for ten years. This is the least I can do.") Tj
