1 0 0 1 50 105 Tm
(Helena's arm tightened around Marysia. "She looks like her father.") Tj
1 0 0 1 50 85 Tm
(The words hung in the air between them. Jochen's face went white. He looked from Helena to Marysia and back again, and Helena watched the mathematics happening behind his eyesthe confirmation, the collapse, the sudden and total restructuring of everything he had thought he knew about the last ten years.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 65 Tm
("You didn't tell me," he said.) Tj
