1 0 0 1 50 155 Tm
("You can arrange papers." Helena laughed. It was a terrible sounddry, sharp, stripped of humor. "The forger who made my daughter's papers was good enough to get her through four years of occupation. What more could you possibly offer?") Tj
1 0 0 1 50 135 Tm
