("You chose everything. That's the point, Jochen. That's the entire point. You chose your family. You chose your name. You chose your safety. And every choice you made led you hereto this room, to this desk, to this uniform. You did not fall into this life. You built it. Brick by brick. Choice by choice.") Tj
