1 0 0 1 50 185 Tm
(They stared at each other. The room was very quiet. Outside, the snow was falling harderthe kind of heavy, deliberate snowfall that transformed landscapes, that buried boundaries, that made the world look, for a while, like something new.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 165 Tm
("Take the papers," Jochen said, finally. His voice was low, drained. "Take them and go. I'll have them ready by tomorrow. Come back to the flat on Aleja Szuchamy billet. I'll leave them in the mailbox by the entrance.") Tj
